PAGE  001   PROM LPT          



00001                     NAM    PROM     LPT
00002                     OPT    O,NOM,NOP  
00003              *
00004              *THIS PROGRAM PATCHES THE DRIVE CONTROLLER 
00005              *PROM TO SUPPORT LINE PRINTER DEVICE
00006              *ALSO PATCHES THE PROM TO SUPPORT EDOS 2.6
00007              *(LOADED EXEC IS BIGGER)
00008              * 
00009              *THIS CODE IS MISSING FROM ORIGINAL PROM, BUT
00010              *EXPECTED TO BE THERE BY EDOS-II
00011              *
00012      EC26    PIAS   EQU    $EC26    PRINTER PIA STATUS/COMMAND RE 
00013      EC27    PIAD   EQU    $EC27    PRINTER PIA DATA REGISTER
00014              *
00015 EAB0                ORG    $EAB0 
00016              *
00017 EAB0 36      LPTC   PSH A           EDOS ROM LINE PRINTER PRINT 1 
00018 EAB1 B6 EC26 LPTCW  LDA A  PIAS     GET PIA STATUS
00019 EAB4 84 02          AND A  #$02 
00020 EAB6 27 F9          BEQ    LPTCW    
00021 EAB8 32             PUL A           
00022 EAB9 B7 EC27        STA A  PIAD     WRITE PIA DATA
00023 EABC 39             RTS             
00024              *
00025 EAD5                ORG    $EAD5 
00026              *
00027 EAD5 86 0D   LDATA  LDA A  #$0D     EDOS ROM LINE PRINTER PRINT S 
00028 EAD7 8D D7          BSR    LPTC 
00029 EAD9 86 0A          LDA A  #$0A 
00030 EADB 8D D3          BSR    LPTC 
00031              *
00032 EADD A6 00   LDATA1 LDA A  0,X      EDOS ROM LINE PRINTER PRINT S 
00033 EADF 81 04          CMP A  #$04 
00034 EAE1 27 05          BEQ    LDATEX 
00035 EAE3 8D CB          BSR    LPTC 
00036 EAE5 08             INX             
00037 EAE6 20 F5          BRA    LDATA1 
00038 EAE8 39      LDATEX RTS             
00039              * 
00040              *SET EXPECTED SIZE OF EXEC WHEN RELOADING EDOS
00041              *
00042 E846                ORG    $E846 
00043 E846 5A             FCB    90       SET ISIZE=90 INSTEAD OF 78
00044              *
00045                     END             

TOTAL ERRORS 00000
